go 1.25.0

// Local dev bridge: loom/go.mod pins swarm v0.0.8, but the Phase-0.5
// swarm hardening (TrustCheck, RequireNodeKeyBinding, inbound gate) it needs
// is unpublished in the ../swarm working tree. Resolve swarm locally until that
// hardening is published and loom bumps its pin. Consumers replace both in
// their own go.work (see io/go.work).
use .
use ../swarm

// Local dev bridge: loom/go.mod pins aether v0.0.117, but the agnostic wire
// (AuthenticatedPrincipal opaque ScopeAxis axes, no named tenant/org fields) it
// now sends/receives is unpublished in the ../aether working tree. Resolve
// aether locally until that wire is published and loom bumps its pin.
use ../aether

// Local dev bridge: loom/go.mod pins ledger v0.0.20 and reach v0.0.14, but
// the directory code reads ledger.Record.Partition and calls
// storage.RequirePartitionColumn, which exist only in the unpublished
// ../ledger working tree. reach is resolved locally with it because the
// published reach still writes ledger.Record.TenantID and would not compile
// against the local ledger. Resolve both locally until they are published and
// loom bumps its pins.
use ../ledger

use ../reach

// loom/go.mod pins tursoraft v0.0.6, but node/meshdb_transport.go implements
// tursoraft's mesh.Mesh contract and node/runtime.go passes it as
// ManagerConfig.Mesh; both exist only in the unpublished ../tursoraft
// working tree. tursoraft resolves go-libsql and policypool through its own
// go.mod replaces. Resolve it locally until it is published and loom bumps
// its pin.
use ../tursoraft
